Kelivo iOS Linux sandbox (Workspace) third-party components
===========================================================

1. iSH-ARM64 (static libraries libish.a, libish_emu.a, libfakefs.a)
--------------------------------------------------------------------
Built at build time (ios/sandbox/build_ish.sh) from the OpenMinis
ish-arm64 fork: https://github.com/OpenMinis/ish-arm64
(pinned revision recorded in build_ish.sh), itself a fork of iSH
(https://github.com/ish-app/ish).

